@FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5109

# Direct calls to the IQ service (dev only; clients go through the gateway, see EdgeGateway.Api.http).
# POST /calculate and POST /debt-payoff are internal: Finance Profile calls them, the gateway does not route them.

### 1) Calculate - healthy profile (expect 100, HIGH: every factor at its maximum, no warnings; version v3 with factorMaximums)
POST {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "http-sample-user",
  "monthlyIncome": 10000,
  "monthlyExpenses": 4000,
  "monthlyDebtPayment": 1000,
  "totalDebt": 12000,
  "cashReserve": 30000,
  "investmentAmount": 0,
  "impatienceLevel": 1
}

### 2) Latest result - note createdAt and resultVersion
GET {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/http-sample-user/latest

### 3) Calculate - SAME user, much weaker numbers (expect 20, LOW: "Low cash reserve", "Elevated debt burden", "Negative savings rate")
POST {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "http-sample-user",
  "monthlyIncome": 10000,
  "monthlyExpenses": 8000,
  "monthlyDebtPayment": 3500,
  "totalDebt": 40000,
  "cashReserve": 2000,
  "investmentAmount": 0,
  "impatienceLevel": 3
}

### 4) Latest again - createdAt unchanged (MERGE updated the row), resultVersion changed (rowversion)
GET {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/http-sample-user/latest

### 5) History - both calculations, oldest first, with scoreChange and movingAverage3 (fn_IqTrend)
GET {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/http-sample-user/history?take=12

### 6) Sample weak profile (expect 27, LOW, 4 warnings; v2 gave 8)
POST {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "http-weak-user",
  "monthlyIncome": 30000,
  "monthlyExpenses": 25000,
  "monthlyDebtPayment": 7000,
  "totalDebt": 90000,
  "cashReserve": 3000,
  "investmentAmount": 10000,
  "impatienceLevel": 5
}

### 7) Very high income, no cash yet (expect 58, MEDIUM, appliedRule null: v3 has no TL rules, v2's VERY_HIGH_INCOME gave 100)
POST {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "http-rule-income-user",
  "monthlyIncome": 1000000,
  "monthlyExpenses": 900000,
  "monthlyDebtPayment": 0,
  "totalDebt": 0,
  "cashReserve": 0,
  "investmentAmount": 0,
  "impatienceLevel": 1
}

### 8) Wealth runway (expect 89, HIGH, appliedRule WEALTH_RUNWAY: 6,500,000 liquid - 1,000,000 debt = 15.8 years of expenses lifts the savings factor; v2 gave 100)
POST {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "http-rule-wealth-user",
  "monthlyIncome": 30000,
  "monthlyExpenses": 29000,
  "monthlyDebtPayment": 0,
  "totalDebt": 1000000,
  "cashReserve": 2000000,
  "investmentAmount": 9000000,
  "impatienceLevel": 1
}

### 9) Solvency cap (expect 0, appliedRule SOLVENCY_CAP: net debt ~240 years of income; the true warnings stay, "Extreme total debt" is added)
POST {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "http-rule-debt-user",
  "monthlyIncome": 40000,
  "monthlyExpenses": 16000,
  "monthlyDebtPayment": 4000,
  "totalDebt": 120000000,
  "cashReserve": 96000,
  "investmentAmount": 10000000,
  "impatienceLevel": 1
}

### 10) Invalid impatience level (expect 400 "Impatience level must be between 1 and 5.")
POST {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "http-sample-user",
  "monthlyIncome": 10000,
  "monthlyExpenses": 4000,
  "monthlyDebtPayment": 1000,
  "cashReserve": 24000,
  "impatienceLevel": 9
}

### 11) Debt payoff (recursive CTE): 10,000 at 1,000/month, default 3.5% -> 13 months, last month 526.51
POST {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/debt-payoff
Content-Type: application/json

{ "totalDebt": 10000, "monthlyPayment": 1000 }

### 12) Debt payoff that never ends: 3,500 = the first month's interest (expect paidOff false, no database call)
POST {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/debt-payoff
Content-Type: application/json

{ "totalDebt": 100000, "monthlyPayment": 3500 }

### 13) Long schedule: more than 100 months needs OPTION (MAXRECURSION 600) (expect 202 months)
POST {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/debt-payoff
Content-Type: application/json

{ "totalDebt": 1000000, "monthlyPayment": 10000, "monthlyInterestRate": 0.008 }

### 14) IQ rule table: every scoring version (v3 active, v1 and v2 kept for old results)
GET {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/scoring-rules

### 15) The active rule set only (measures, anchors, maximums, warnings, solvency cap, wealth runway)
GET {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/scoring-rules/current

### 16) The old v1 rule set (6 factors incl. RiskAlignment)
GET {{FinancialIQ.Api_HostAddress}}/api/financial-iq/scoring-rules/v1
